      "message": "Publish SHA256SUMS.txt with every release\n\nThe publish job now writes SHA256SUMS.txt (sha256sum format) for all\nrelease assets, checks it, and uploads it with the release, so downloads\ncan be verified and launchers such as ArtCraft Launcher can install\nCamCraft (storytold/craft-launcher#1545).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
